  "body": "A spacious 255m2 (approx) home with beautiful marina and sea views, refreshed interiors and a fresh exterior finish - ready for its new owners to move in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nBuilt with a rendered brick veneer cavity-based exterior, this substantial four-bedroom home combines solid construction, generous living spaces and a versatile multi-level layout.\r\n\r\nFRESHLY UPDATED & MOVE-IN READY\r\nThe home has been fully repainted inside and out - including all interior walls and ceilings - so there is nothing to do for years to come. The exterior has been painted with Dulux Weathershield, and the interior with Dulux Wash & Wear. The bathrooms have also been modernised, with brand-new vanities in the bathrooms and guest toilet.\r\n\r\nSPACE, VIEWS & FLEXIBLE FAMILY LIVING\r\n• Four bedrooms, including an impressive upper-level master retreat\r\n• Two bathrooms, including an ensuite\r\n• Three separate toilets\r\n• Master bedroom with walk-in wardrobe and spa bath\r\n• Three additional double bedrooms on the ground floor with sliding-door garden access\r\n• Marina and sea views from open-plan living and dining areas, balconies, and master suite\r\n• Generous 255m2 (approx) floor area\r\n• 312m2 freehold section (more or less)\r\n• Double internal-access garage\r\n• Two additional off-street parking spaces\r\n• Low-maintenance grounds, tiled roof, and full Code Compliance Certificate (CCC)\r\n\r\nThe multi-level design offers excellent separation for families, teenagers, guests or those working from home.\r\n\r\n Enjoy the privacy of the upper-level master suite and the flexibility of three additional double bedrooms.\r\n\r\nENJOY THE GULF HARBOUR LIFESTYLE\r\nWith the marina, cafés, restaurants, beaches, quality local schools and Shakespear Regional Park nearby, you can enjoy the best of coastal living. The Gulf Harbour ferry terminal also offers a convenient connection to Auckland CBD.\r\n\r\nSolid rendered brick construction. \r\nLow-maintenance, move-in-ready living. \r\n\r\nBeautiful marina and sea outlook. Generous space for the whole family.\r\n\r\nCome and see what makes this home special. Contact Olga Grinkevich to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our open homes.",
